{"id":"fbaa5909ac75db97ce832c4c57382bb4f20f42e3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229667","title":"Claude Opus 5 发布，性能接近 Fable 5","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"alexluo1","excerpt":"Claude - @alexluo1 - https://i.imgur.com/2elLzq8.png https://i.imgur.com/1p6dd3m.png https://i.imgur.com/teKdShH.png","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902397\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7f82ea103de35fe33a2e0c2be334fd44?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"luckycat\" data-uid=\"136935\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luckycat\">luckycat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 02:23:46 +08:00\">21h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试了一下暂时没感觉到和 Fable 5 有明显区别，从榜单来看 Opus 5 和 Fable 5 似乎水平接近甚至是提升，但是从 API 价格来看，Opus 5 和 Opus 4.8 是相同的价格，是 Fable 5 的一半。所以目前定位依然是 Fable 5 &gt; Opus 5</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902402\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7f82ea103de35fe33a2e0c2be334fd44?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"luckycat\" data-uid=\"136935\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luckycat\">luckycat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 02:27:59 +08:00\">21h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Anthorpic 急着推出 Opus 5 模型，很可能是 Fable 5 过于消耗算力，推测接下来会把套餐的 Fable 5 用量降低。算力是恒定的，模型用到的资源基本就是拆东墙补西墙。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902428\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7d70/1b2f/553821_normal.png?m=1778485624\" alt=\"laikicka\" data-uid=\"553821\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/laikicka\">laikicka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 04:09:33 +08:00\">20h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试了一下暂时没感觉到和 Kimi3 没有明显区别</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902497\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3574/4bfd/681572_normal.png?m=1715825471\" alt=\"aohan0905\" data-uid=\"681572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aohan0905\">aohan0905</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 08:24:24 +08:00\">15h 58m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我就想知道 codex 还重不重置</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902514\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/721e/049e/6111_normal.png?m=1607225101\" alt=\"asprin\" data-uid=\"6111\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/asprin\">asprin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 08:37:29 +08:00\">15h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>kimi 的威胁还是太严重了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902562\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/23c63aaf767ddce9810be82d488fb3b4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jaskle\" data-uid=\"420848\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jaskle\">jaskle</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 09:08:58 +08:00\">15h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>对程序员肯定是好事，但是没有超过 fable5 的新模型就出平替低价版，那你这不卷价格了，将来能靠高溢价回收成本吗，投资者的钱不打水漂了？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17902777\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ea21f7b5493b690265cf2458a83c36c9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mightofcode\" data-uid=\"190743\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mightofcode\">mightofcode</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 10:49:20 +08:00\">13h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在我最想要的是高性价比模型<br>我做的项目还不需要这么高级的模型 但是 token 烧得真的很快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17903347\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a550/1d50/160937_normal.png?m=1495497682\" alt=\"louzhumuyou\" data-uid=\"160937\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/louzhumuyou\">louzhumuyou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-25 15:50:59 +08:00\">8h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很奇怪，为啥这次新模型没有重置流量，我记得原来发布新模型，都会额度重置的呀。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"1 luckycat 21h 58m ago 试了一下暂时没感觉到和 Fable 5 有明显区别，从榜单来看 Opus 5 和 Fable 5 似乎水平接近甚至是提升，但是从 API 价格来看，Opus 5 和 Opus 4.8 是相同的价格，是 Fable 5 的一半。所以目前定位依然是 Fable 5 > Opus 5 2 luckycat 21h 54m ago Anthorpic 急着推出 Opus 5 模型，很可能是 Fable 5 过于消耗算力，推测接下来会把套餐的 Fable 5 用量降低。算力是恒定的，模型用到的资源基本就是拆东墙补西墙。 3 laikicka 20h 13m ago 试了一下暂时没感觉到和 Kimi3 没有明显区别 4 aohan0905 15h 58m ago via iPhone 1 我就想知道 codex 还重不重置 5 asprin 15h 45m ago kimi 的威胁还是太严重了 7 jaskle 15h 13m ago 对程序员肯定是好事，但是没有超过 fable5 的新模型就出平替低价版，那你这不卷价格了，将来能靠高溢价回收成本吗，投资者的钱不打水漂了？ 9 mightofcode 13h 33m ago 现在我最想要的是高性价比模型我做的项目还不需要这么高级的模型 但是 token 烧得真的很快 12 louzhumuyou 8h 31m ago 很奇怪，为啥这次新模型没有重置流量，我记得原来发布新模型，都会额度重置的呀。","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T16:22:37.205Z","ok":true}